name 'ai-generated-design-preassessment-q12_2025'

question 'A small business owner uses an AI tool to design a product page, but some images don\'t line up and the buttons overlap on mobile devices. What should the owner do to fix these issues?'

right 'Adjust the AI prompt to describe the problems and test the updated design.'
wrong 'Stop using AI tools and hire someone else to rebuild the page.'
wrong 'Keep running the same prompt until it looks better by chance.'
wrong 'Add more pictures to hide the layout problems.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 3, 6, 10
MARKDOWN
